  "section_notes": "The final S2 keeps the 5% limit and numeric per-model results for owners and prospective buyers, but removes any automatic sales stop, leaving sales restrictions to regulator discretion. S3 gives existing units a 72-month retrofit deadline with an open 'where feasible' escape, which favours Northwind's installed base. S5 sets a mandatory recall at 8 per 100,000 with no transition, which would bind Halcyon's Ember 8 at 9.9."
